      <span class="content-split__eyebrow">Our History</span>
      <h2 class="content-split__heading">Growing Together Since 2007</h2>
      <p class="content-split__text">The Community Foundation of Teton Valley was established to serve as a permanent philanthropic resource for Teton Valley. Since our founding, we have grown to manage over 50 funds, support 64+ nonprofits, and distribute millions in grants and scholarships.</p>
      <p class="content-split__text">As an established charitable bank, we bring professional fund management and grantmaking expertise to our community while maintaining a deep focus on the needs and opportunities unique to Teton Valley.</p>
